  "steps": [
    {
      "text": "• Preheat oven to 240°C/220°C fan-forced.\n• Grate carrot.\n• Finely chop brown onion.\n• Finely chop garlic cloves.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/recipe/step-67a9a3c567a4f34c14b7e3ce-dc93d031.jpeg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Cut pumpkin into thin wedges.\n• Place pumpkin on a lined oven tray. Drizzle with olive oil, season with mild North Indian spice blend, salt and pepper. Toss to coat.\n• Roast until tender, 20-25 minutes. TIP: Peel the pumpkin if you prefer!",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/recipe/step-67a9a3c567a4f34c14b7e3ce-33f16845.jpeg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• In a large saucepan, heat a generous drizzle of olive oil over medium-high heat.\n• Add carrot and onion and cook, stirring, until tender, 2-3 minutes.\n• Add Bengal curry paste (see ingredients) and cook, until fragrant, 1-2 minutes.\n• Stir in white rice, the water and a generous pinch of salt.\n• Bring to the boil. Cover and reduce heat to medium-low. Cook for 12 minutes, then remove pan from heat.\n• Keep covered until rice is tender and the water is absorbed, 15 minutes. TIP: The rice will finish cooking in its own steam, don't peek!",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/recipe/step-67a9a3c567a4f34c14b7e3ce-1c0c562e.jpeg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• When pumpkin has 5 minutes remaining, in a small microwave-safe bowl, microwave garlic with a drizzle of olive oil in 10 second bursts, until fragrant.\n• Add Greek-style yoghurt to garlic oil mixture and combine. Season to taste.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/recipe/step-67a9a3c567a4f34c14b7e3ce-52bfd13e.jpeg"
    },
    {
      "text": "Once biryani has finished cooking, stir through baby spinach leaves until wilted. Season to taste.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/recipe/step-67a9a3c567a4f34c14b7e3ce-bbd1aef1.jpeg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Divide veggie biryani between bowls.\n• Top with pumpkin. Drizzle over garlic yoghurt and tamarind chutney.\n• Sprinkle over flaked almonds to serve. Enjoy!",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/recipe/step-67a9a3c567a4f34c14b7e3ce-b55ca381.jpeg"
    }
  ]
}
